{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>EXIT - N.F</strong>. is a <strong>FREE</strong> <strong>VR</strong> extraction game. Your <strong>objective</strong> is to <strong>escape</strong> from a strange place with a <strong>worrying atmosphere.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In order to escape from it, you will have to find <strong>different objects</strong> to repel the creatures and <strong>access different places.</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Features:</i></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- <strong>Use tools</strong> to advance and <strong>grow back\u00a0creatures</strong>. But be careful to <strong>use wisely</strong> so you don\u2019t run out of durability. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- <strong>Unscripted universe</strong>, depending on the player\u2019s actions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- <strong>Appearance of random objects</strong> to always offer different <strong>games</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- <strong>Creatures reactive</strong> to the <strong>player\u2019s actions...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Beware,</strong> the more time you <strong>spend</strong> in these places, the more they will become strange and play with your <strong>mind</strong>...</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3704000?t=1746900224","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704000/5ca879f47025a278082bc75a325f11df567f90ec/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746900224","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704000/206706efdf76725b32cb88e37f2b86c381e28cd4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746900224","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704000/206706efdf76725b32cb88e37f2b86c381e28cd4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746900224","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Only","id":54}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"There are screamers, so creatures that jump to your face and loud sounds"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>EXIT - N.F</strong>. is a <strong>FREE</strong> <strong>VR</strong> extraction game. Your <strong>objective</strong> is to <strong>escape</strong> from a strange place with a <strong>worrying atmosphere.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In order to escape from it, you will have to find <strong>different objects</strong> to repel the creatures and <strong>access different places.</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Features:</i></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- <strong>Use tools</strong> to advance and <strong>grow back\u00a0creatures</strong>. But be careful to <strong>use wisely</strong> so you don\u2019t run out of durability. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- <strong>Unscripted universe</strong>, depending on the player\u2019s actions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- <strong>Appearance of random objects</strong> to always offer different <strong>games</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- <strong>Creatures reactive</strong> to the <strong>player\u2019s actions...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Beware,</strong> the more time you <strong>spend</strong> in these places, the more they will become strange and play with your <strong>mind</strong>...</p>","developers":["Picxel Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704000/98efcff45892c27af0ad28915109f101114d136e/header.jpg?t=1746900224","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{